{"parentUuid": "0b84d0e7-471b-47d8-b0ce-4249bf74467f", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"model": "claude-fable-5-1", "id": "msg_011CfC1f3ubw3aKs8cLjHN1f", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "## What a PTY is\n\n- A pseudo-terminal (PTY) is a pair of virtual devices that emulate a hardware terminal. The master side is held by a program like a terminal emulator or `ssh`, while the slave side is what a shell or process sees as its controlling terminal.\n- The kernel's line discipline sits between the two, handling echo, line editing, and translating keys like Ctrl-C into signals.\n- Programs check whether stdin is a TTY to decide on **interactive behavior** such as colors, prompts, and buffering.\n\n```bash\nstty -a\n```"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 8771, "cache_read_input_tokens": 28370, "output_tokens": 189, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 8771, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "not_available", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 189, "cache_read_input_tokens": 28370, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 8771, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 8771}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "apiBlockIndex": 0, "requestId": "req_011CfC1f3PqaFRgNEndTBV4s", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "9614bd5e-10f1-449e-bf52-c1f340856035", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T02:30:37.602Z", "advisorModel": "claude-fable-5-1", "effort": "medium", "perTurnEffort": "medium", "session_id": "62626262-2222-4333-8444-555555555555", "userType": "external", "entrypoint": "cli", "cwd": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-ipeerbhai